                <h5>Rapid API Integration</h5>
                <p>Effortlessly connect with RESTful services. Snippets for GET, POST, PUT, and authentication save you hours of setup.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
                <div class="feature-icon mb-3 text-primary">
                    <i class="fas fa-lock fa-2x"></i>
                </div>
