                <p>Implement secure authentication flows—from JWT tokens to Azure AD—with best-practice, reusable code.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
                <div class="feature-icon mb-3 text-primary">
                    <i class="fas fa-database fa-2x"></i>
                </div>
                <h5>Reliable Data Access</h5>
                <p>Streamline data access in Entity Framework or SQL. Robust, easy-to-adapt CRUD and connection snippets included.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
                <div class="feature-icon mb-3 text-primary">
                    <i class="fas fa-database fa-2x"></i>
                </div>
                <h5>Powerful String Operations	</h5>
                <p>Simplify text parsing, formatting, and validation with concise, reusable string manipulation snippets.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
                <div class="feature-icon mb-3 text-primary">
                    <i class="fas fa-database fa-2x"></i>
                </div>
                <h5>Robust Error Handling</h5>
                <p>Improve stability with production-ready error handling, logging, and custom exception snippets.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
                <div class="feature-icon mb-3 text-primary">
                    <i class="fas fa-database fa-2x"></i>
                </div>
                <h5>Seamless Dependency Injection</h5>
                <p>Set up testable, modular .NET apps quickly. Standard dependency injection patterns for services and repositories.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
                <div class="feature-icon mb-3 text-primary">
                    <i class="fas fa-database fa-2x"></i>
                </div>
                <h5>Essential LINQ Queries	</h5>
                <p>Quickly filter, group, and transform data in memory with our curated set of must-have LINQ query snippets.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
                <div class="feature-icon mb-3 text-primary">
                    <i class="fas fa-database fa-2x"></i>
                </div>
                <h5>One-click Import</h5>
                <p>Use out of the box in Visual Studio and VS Code thanks to pre-formatted snippet files.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
                <div class="feature-icon mb-3 text-primary">
                    <i class="fas fa-database fa-2x"></i>
                </div>
                <h5>Thorough Documentation	</h5>
                <p>
                    Every snippet is commented and explained, with a comprehensive README to help you adapt and learn.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4 text-center">
                <div class="feature-icon mb-3 text-primary">
                    <i class="fas fa-database fa-2x"></i>
                </div>
                <h5>Lifetime Updates</h5>
                <p>
                    Get free updates as new .NET features emerge—your snippet pack keeps getting better.
                </p>
            </div>
            <!-- Continue for other features (String Ops, Error Handling, etc.) -->
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
@Html.Partial("_testimonials")

<section style="background:#f6f8fa; padding:3em 0;">
    <div style="max-width:800px;margin:auto;">
